{"id": "86279", "name": "כלל קרמר – פתרון מלא של מערכת 3×3 (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Use Cramer's rule to find the solution of the system:</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\ =\\ {{CT:1}} , \\]</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:2}}\\ =\\ {{CT:3}} , \\]</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:4}}\\ =\\ {{CT:5}} , \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( x = \\) [[input:ans1]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\( y = \\) [[input:ans2]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\( z = \\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]] [[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Cramer's rule states that x = \\(\\frac{D_{x}}{D}\\) where \\(D\\) is the determinant of the matrix and \\(D_{x}\\) is the determinant of the matrix with the x column replaced by the numbers on the right hand side of the equations and similarly y = \\(\\frac{D_{y}}{D}\\) and z = \\(\\frac{D_{z}}{D}\\). Therefore for the system,</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{{CT:0}}\\ =\\ {{CT:1}} , \\]</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:2}}\\ =\\ {{CT:3}} , \\]</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:4}}\\ =\\ {{CT:5}} , \\]</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ D = det{{CT:6}}={{CT:7}},\\]</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[D_{x} = det{{CT:8}}={{CT:9}},\\]</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[D_{y} = det{{CT:10}}={{CT:11}},\\]</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[D_{z} = det{{CT:12}}={{CT:13}}.\\]</p><p>Hence,</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[x=\\frac{{CT:9}}{{CT:7}} = {{CT:14}},\\]</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[y=\\frac{{CT:11}}{{CT:7}} = {{CT:15}},\\]</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[z=\\frac{{CT:13}}{{CT:7}} = {{CT:16}}.\\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer[1]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.34, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your x-value is correct.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextn